%h1 Hushaboom

%p.lead
  A noise generator for iPhone, iPad, and Mac. White, pink, and brown noise
  plus ocean waves, wind, rain, and rustling trees.

%p
  Every nature sound is synthesized rather than sampled, so nothing loops and
  there is no seam to hear. Mix any of the seven sounds together, shape each
  one with its own controls, and set a sleep timer.

%h2 Support

%p
  Questions, bug reports, and feature requests:
  %a{href: 'mailto:hushaboom-support@burns.io'} hushaboom-support@burns.io

%h2 Privacy

%p
  Hushaboom collects nothing and sends nothing. It has no network code at all.

%p
